    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "Select a standard white or basic bread cycle and start the machine."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "When the cycle is complete, confirm the loaf is fully set in the center and reaches at least 160°F internally. Remove it from the pan and cool before slicing.",
